          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be3981448e4ffe0199678712"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0008",
      "content": "Dehondtら（2026）はC-MAPSS FD001で9つのRUL手法を再実装して同一protocolで比較し、一部深層手法は良好だが普遍的な最良手法は同定できないと報告する。",
      "source_locator": "Signal Processing abstract/discussion",
      "note_type": "Result",
      "selection_reason": "Representative definition, methodological family, benchmark constraint or uncertainty in approved prognostics scope",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000191",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be3981e58668d2ea26b44d27",
          "title": "EV-000313"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0009",
      "content": "2025年のRULレビューはmodel-based、data-driven、hybridの3分類を採用し、エンジン・軸受・電池などのデータセットを概観する。",
      "source_locator": "Review highlights/abstract",
      "note_type": "Method",
      "selection_reason": "Representative definition, methodological family, benchmark constraint or uncertainty in approved prognostics scope",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000193",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be398131ba40dd499341c945",
          "title": "EV-000314"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0010",
      "content": "Wangら（2025）は部分的なセンサ故障・欠損下のonline RUL推定に深層学習とconformal予測を使う不確実性定量化を提案した。",
      "source_locator": "Article highlights/abstract",
      "note_type": "Method",
      "selection_reason": "Representative definition, methodological family, benchmark constraint or uncertainty in approved prognostics scope",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000194",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/40fe5855be39816497b4de549dc40773",
          "title": "EV-000315"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0011",
      "content": "Lingら（2019）は、劣化速度が途中で変化する二相Gamma過程に対し、変化時点の不確実性を組み込むBayesianおよびlikelihood推定によってRULを予測した。シミュレーションとLEDデータを用いて評価した。",
      "source_locator": "Abstract",
      "selection_reason": "Original publication fills a previously underrepresented classical or degradation-method family.",
      "note_type": "Method",
      "provenance": {
        "source_id": "SRC-000197",
        "evidence_note": {
          "notion_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/410e5855be3981abb371f11714ccf7c4",
          "title": "EV-000318"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E0012",
      "content": "NASAのN-CMAPSS記述によれば、実飛行条件を入力に用いるrun-to-failureエンジン系列でも、エンジン劣化過程自体はsimulation modelで生成されている。",
      "source_locator": "NASA NTRS 20205001125, Description",
      "note_type": "Data",
      "selection_reason": "Original data generation, Bayesian RUL, gamma deterioration and deep prognostics methods supporting a more representative methodological review.",
      "provenance": {
