    {
      "evidence_id": "E0016",
      "content": "van Noortwijk（2009）はGamma過程が時間とともに進む確率的劣化のモデル化に利用され、点検・保全の意思決定に応用されることをレビューした。",
      "source_locator": "Reliability Engineering & System Safety abstract",
      "note_type": "Method",
      "selection_reason": "Original data generation, Bayesian RUL, gamma deterioration and deep prognostics methods supporting a more representative methodological review.",
